OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for piloting small boat
OL,4,Acarrying 26 others
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 18 months for
OL,7,Fpiloting a small boat carrying 26 other
OL,8,Fpeople, including six children, towards
OL,9,Fthe Kent coast.
OL,11,FJemal Abdela, 32, was sentenced after
OL,12,Fpleading guilty to the offence of
OL,13,Fendangering others during a sea
OL,14,Fcrossing to the UK without valid entry
OL,15,Fclearance on July 25.
OL,17,FWinchester Crown Court heard Abdela,
OL,18,Fwho is Eritrean, had also attempted to
OL,19,Fdisguise the fact he had been driving
OL,20,Fthe black inflatable across the Channel
OL,21,Fwhen it was approached by immigration
OL,22,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
