OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for piloting small boat
OL,4,Acarrying 26 others
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Home Office spokesman said Abdela was
OL,7,Fthe 20th small boat pilot to be
OL,8,Fimprisoned in four months for
OL,9,Fendangering lives at sea.
